  "study": "The two older oblique views distinguish the staff from both masonry ornaments. The camera model from the signed 2025 study accepts any explicitly specified setback; the working value is 1.75 m. The 2012 visible shaft/ornament ratio and the existing prefabricated crest depth constrain its scale. No installed survey or measured socket height is available."
